 da: angular width (degrees), \n#      v: median velocity (km/s)\n#     dv: variation (1 sigma) of velocity over the width of the CME\n#   minv: lowest velocity detected within the CME\n#   maxv: highest velocity detected within the CME\n#  halo?: II if da>90, III if da>180, IV if da>270, indicating potential halo/partial halo CME\n# \n  </PRE>\n <td valign='top'>\n  <PRE>\n# CME |          t0    | dt0| pa | da |  v  |  dv | minv| maxv| halo?\n  <a href=\"CME0023/CME.html\" target=\"_blank\" >0023</a>|2026/09/12 22:00| 02 | 349| 068| 1624| 0639| 0213| 1896|    \n  <a href=\"CME0022/CME.html\" target=\"_blank\" >0022</a>|2026/09/12 21:48| 02 | 120| 038| 1489| 0368| 0800| 1953|    \n  <a href=\"CME0021/CME.html\" target=\"_blank\" >0021</a>|2026/09/12 21:12| 05 | 276| 042| 1357| 0584| 0182| 1896|    \n  <a href=\"CME0020/CME.html\" target=\"_blank\" >0020</a>|2026/09/12 17:24| 07 | 199| 120| 0193| 0025| 0146| 0267|  II\n  <a href=\"CME0019/CME.html\" target=\"_blank\" >0019</a>|2026/09/12 15:48| 01 | 334| 010| 0128| 0012| 0107| 0138|    \n  <a href=\"CME0018/CME.html\" target=\"_blank\" >0018</a>|2026/09/11 21:48| 01 | 326| 010| 042"
